{"id":"msg-1779262481240-thjpfw","type":"assistant","content":"这是一张**电气接线端子图**（Connector Pinout Diagram），标注为 **CN6**。\n\n看起来是某种**暖通设备**（如热泵、空调、壁挂炉等）的控制板接线定义。以下是接线定义：\n\n```datatable\n{\n  \"title\": \"CN6 接线端子定义\",\n  \"columns\": [\n    { \"key\": \"pin\", \"label\": \"引脚\", \"type\": \"number\" },\n    { \"key\": \"color\", \"label\": \"线色\", \"type\": \"text\" },\n    { \"key\": \"function\", \"label\": \"功能\", \"type\": \"text\" }\n  ],\n  \"rows\": [\n    { \"pin\": 1, \"color\": \"蓝 (Blue)\", \"function\": \"N（零线）\" },\n    { \"pin\": 2, \"color\": \"白 (White)\", \"function\": \"N（零线）\" },\n    { \"pin\": 3, \"color\": \"黑 (Black)\", \"function\": \"N（零线）\" },\n    { \"pin\": 4, \"color\": \"棕 (Brown)\", \"function\": \"COMP（压缩机）\" },\n    { \"pin\": 5, \"color\": \"黄 (Yellow)\", \"function\": \"HS-HEAT（主加热/制热）\" },\n    { \"pin\": 6, \"color\": \"红 (Red)\", \"function\": \"BC-HEAT（辅助加热/备用加热）\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**功能说明：**\n- **N** — 零线（共3根，蓝/白/黑）\n- **COMP** — 压缩机控制线（棕色）\n- **HS-HEAT** — 主加热/制热（黄色）\n- **BC-HEAT** — 辅助/备用加热（红色）\n- 右侧的\"灰\"可能是接地线（PE）\n\n这是用于指导维修人员或安装人员正确接线的参考图纸。","timestamp":1779262481240,"isIntermediate":false,"turnId":"msg_a8697b03-630e-4b49-bcc6-ce3aac1b3a64","thinkingLevel":"think"}
